sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Accountant as 🧑‍💼 Accountant
    actor Student as 🎓 Student
    participant Portal as 💻 Student / Staff Portal
    participant FinEngine as 💳 Finance Service
    participant BankGateway as 🏦 Payment Gateway / Bank
    participant Ledger as 📑 General Ledger
    participant DB as 🗄️ Database

    Accountant->>Portal: Triggers Term Fee Generation for Semester
    Portal->>FinEngine: POST /api/v1/finance/challans/generate-batch
    FinEngine->>DB: Query FeeStructure for each enrolled student's program
    FinEngine->>DB: Check ScholarshipAward (deduct percentage/amount)
    FinEngine->>DB: Bulk insert FeeChallan & FeeChallanItem (status = UNPAID)
    FinEngine-->>Portal: Challans Generated Notification Sent to Students

    Student->>Portal: Views Fee Invoice & Downloads Challan Voucher
    Portal->>FinEngine: GET /api/v1/finance/challans/my
    FinEngine->>DB: Fetch FeeChallan with itemized breakdown
    DB-->>Portal: Itemized Challan (Tuition, Lab, Exam, Library)

    alt Online Card / Gateway Payment
        Student->>Portal: Clicks "Pay Online via Card/Online Gateway"
        Portal->>BankGateway: Initialize Checkout Session { amount: totalAmount }
        BankGateway-->>Student: Enter Card / OTP Details
        Student->>BankGateway: Authorizes Transaction
        BankGateway-->>FinEngine: Webhook: PAYMENT_SUCCESS { transactionRef, amount }
        FinEngine->>DB: Atomic Tx [Create Payment, update FeeChallan status = PAID, balanceAmount = 0]
        FinEngine->>Ledger: Record Transaction (Credit: Tuition Revenue, Debit: Main Bank Account)
        FinEngine-->>Portal: Real-time Payment Confirmation
        Portal-->>Student: Display Digital Receipt & Unlock Services
    else Offline Bank Deposit
        Student->>BankGateway: Deposits Cash/Draft at Bank Branch
        Student->>Portal: Uploads Bank Deposit Receipt & Scanned Voucher
        Portal->>FinEngine: POST /api/v1/finance/payments { challanId, transactionRef, receiptUrl }
        FinEngine->>DB: Create Payment (isVerified = false)
        Accountant->>Portal: Verifies Bank Deposit against Bank Statement
        Portal->>FinEngine: PATCH /api/v1/finance/payments/:id/verify
        FinEngine->>DB: Update Payment isVerified = true, update FeeChallan status = PAID
        FinEngine->>Ledger: Record Transaction in General Ledger
        FinEngine-->>Student: SMS/Email Receipt & Status: PAID
    end
